+- **FR-029a**: The store MUST be a single UTF-8 JSON object holding a format marker and the account records keyed by username; binary material (salt, derived key) MUST be recorded in a text encoding. Content that does not parse as JSON, lacks the expected format marker, or holds an account record missing any required field MUST be treated as a corrupt store under FR-029.
+- **FR-029b**: Every change to the store MUST be written whole and committed atomically — written to a temporary file in the same directory, flushed to disk, then renamed over the target — so that an interrupted run leaves either the previous store or the new one intact, never a partially written file.
